259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 111 0 R
/T (The columns are on totally different scales \(Balance is in the 10,000s, cc2_miles is 1 to 3\). K-Means, hierarchical and DBSCAN all use distances, so the big columns would take over everything. I'm using StandardScaler \(mean 0, std 1\) to fix this.)
