/T (Task 3 \(EDA\): I looked at the shape of every column with histograms and count plots, at the relationships between columns with a correlation heatmap, scatter plots and a pairplot, and I used PCA to get a 2D picture of the data. The results are in Section 3 of this report.)
/E (Task 3 \(EDA\): I looked at the shape of every column with histograms and count plots, at the relationships between columns with a correlation heatmap, scatter plots and a pairplot, and I used PCA to get a 2D picture of the data. The results are in Section 3 of this report.)
