/T (DBSCAN mostly split the customers using the Award? column. This is because it's a 0/1 column, so after scaling the distance between award and non-award customers is about 2 in this one column, bigger than eps = 1.2, so the points can't connect across. So the clusters are basically "no award" vs "got an award".)
/E (DBSCAN mostly split the customers using the Award? column. This is because it's a 0/1 column, so after scaling the distance between award and non-award customers is about 2 in this one column, bigger than eps = 1.2, so the points can't connect across. So the clusters are basically "no award" vs "got an award".)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
