1344 0 obj
<<
/Title (DBSCAN mostly split the customers using the Award? column. This is because it's a 0/1 column, so after scaling the distance between award and non-award customers is about 2 in this one column, bigger than eps = 1.2, so the points can't connect across. So the clusters are basically "no award" vs "got an award".)
/Dest [31 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1212 0 R
/Next 1465 0 R
>>
endobj
1345 0 obj
<<
