/Title (Before starting I imported the libraries I needed: pandas and numpy for the data, matplotlib and seaborn for the plots, scikit-learn for scaling, PCA, the three clustering algorithms, the silhouette score and the nearest neighbour search \(used for the k-distance plot\), and scipy for the linkage matrix and the dendrogram. I also fixed the random seed \(42\) so that the results can be repeated.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1333 0 R
>>
