/Title (In this 2D view the two big clusters \(blue 0 and orange 1\) look mixed together in the lower left part, and the grey noise points are spread over the upper and right parts, where the customers are far from each other. Cluster 2 \(green\) is only a few points at the left side. So the DBSCAN clusters are not easy to see in the PCA plot, and the profile table below explains what separates them.)
