1543 0 obj
<<
/Title (Task 4 \(K-Means\): I ran K-Means for K from 2 to 10 and used the elbow curve and the silhouette score to choose K, then looked at the average values of each cluster. Task 5 \(Hierarchical\): I drew a dendrogram with Ward linkage, compared the Ward, complete, average and single linkages for 3 to 6 clusters, and then profiled the Ward clusters. Task 6 \(DBSCAN\): I used a k-distance plot to get an idea of eps, tried a grid of eps and min_samples values, and then profiled the clusters of the setting I chose. Task 7: I compared the three algorithms with their silhouette scores and plots. Sections 4 and 5 of this report have the results.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
